---
import ProseLayout from '../../layouts/ProseLayout.astro';
import Card from '../../components/ds/Card.astro';
---
<ProseLayout
  title="Privacy information"
  metaTitle="Privacy | PumpOS"
  description="Privacy information and contact details for the PumpOS pilot."
  path="/legal/privacy"
  eyebrow="PumpOS pilot"
  noindex
>
  <Card as="aside" class="prose-callout" role="note">
    The full privacy policy is being prepared for launch. This page is not a final privacy policy.
  </Card>
  <h2>Contacting us</h2>
  <p>If you email us to arrange a demo, share your name, station name and preferred contact details. Customer records and financial files are not needed for the demonstration.</p>
  <h2>Your station's information</h2>
  <p>PumpOS separates organizations' operational data. We will discuss access and onboarding requirements before your station joins the pilot.</p>
  <h2>Privacy questions</h2>
  <p>For questions about information you have shared with us, email <a href="mailto:hello@pumpos.app?subject=Privacy%20question">hello@pumpos.app</a>.</p>
</ProseLayout>
